  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Prevention and Response to Violence and Criminality in Ecuador (PREVIC)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Prevencin y Respuesta a la Violencia y la Criminalidad en el Ecuador (PREVIC)-INV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo de esta operacin es contribuir a prevenir los delitos asociados a Grupos de Delincuencia Organizada (GDO), y a reducir su impunidad, en territorios priorizados. Los Objetivos Especficos de Desarrollo (OED) son: (i) aumentar la cobertura de los programas de prevencin del Crimen Organizado (CO) y la atencin a poblaciones vulnerables; (ii) aumentar la eficacia de la investigacin criminal; y (iii) aumentar las capacidades del personal y uso de la informacin para la gestin de la seguridad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of this operation is to contribute to preventing crimes associated with Organized Crime Groups (OCGs) and to reduce their impunity in prioritized territories. The Specific Development Objectives are: (i) to increase the coverage of Organized Crime prevention programs and attention to vulnerable populations; (ii) to increase the effectiveness of criminal investigation; and (iii) to increase the capacities of personnel and the use of information for security management.</narrative>
  </description>
